_at":"2018-09-28T11:35:51Z","closed_at":"2018-09-28T11:35:51Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"It's not possible to build the grafana image.\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n1) `git clone 'https://github.com/loadimpact/k6'`\r\n2) `cd k6`\r\n3) `git submodule update --init`\r\n4) `docker-compose up -d influxdb grafana`\r\n\r\nGrafana image won't be built\r\nOutput:\r\n```\r\nBuilding grafana\r\nStep 1/6 : FROM grafana/grafana\r\n ---> 1bfead9ff707\r\nStep 2/6 : RUN apt-get update && apt-get -y install curl\r\n ---> Running in 3e89ad9d7a9c\r\nReading package lists...\r\nE: List directory /var/lib/apt/lists/partial is missing. - Acquire (13: Permission denied)\r\nERROR: Service 'grafana' failed to build: The command '/bin/sh -c apt-get update && apt-get -y install curl' returned a non-zero code: 100\r\n```\r\n\r\nHint: The build will pass when we change the `Dockerfile.grafana` to use basic grafana/grafana image < v5.1.0\r\nhttps://github.com/loadimpact/k6/blob/master/Dockerfile.grafana#L1\r\ne.g. `FROM grafana/grafana:5.0.4`\r\n\r\nIt looks like there were major changes in grafana docker image v5.1.0 which prevents the build process to finish.","closed_by":{"login":"na--","id":3336773,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzY3NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3336773?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/na--","html_url":"https://github.com/na--","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/na--/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/na--/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/na--/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/na--/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/na--/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n